<title>POLAND: ESPEBEPE NOV NET TURNS TO LOSS.</title>
<headline>ESPEBEPE NOV NET TURNS TO LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.98 vs   0.09 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.98 vs   0.14 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.91 vs   0.69 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   12.01 vs  11.94</p>
